    "reason": "[ev-dea2079e5dc4] and [ev-2bbc505de6bb] call this a breaking change: earlier chart values enabled exceptions for all namespaces, and 1.13 \"will impact users who were relying on policy exceptions to be enabled in all namespaces\". This is more than a working default change, so behavior-change likely under-states it. Neither excerpt says what happens to PolicyExceptions outside the allowed namespace: they could be rejected or silently ignored, and the effect on the workloads they exempted is not stated. So the failure kind cannot be chosen. Also, the cited text bundles a second, unrelated change: the wildcard view permissions removal [ev-01e97dc9c4df]. That change needs its own assertion.",
